WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.614 line:82%
[Mic] What should we record
in the next experiment?

2
00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:08.195 line:82%
[Mac audio] Let’s count completed tasks and
record their display preference separately.

3
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.300 line:82%
Open the paper from the meeting using its DOI.

4
00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:18.080 line:82%
Global Zoom had the most task completions.

5
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:21.231 line:82%
Participants finished 23 of 24 trials.

6
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:27.129 line:82%
Six of the eight participants, however,
preferred Focus+Context.

7
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:32.350 line:82%
What were we going to record next time?

8
00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:39.556 line:82%
At 0:09 in the recording, they agree to log task
completions and display preference separately.

9
00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:46.250 line:82%
Retrieve that quote with its timestamp
and use it to draft the study plan.

10
00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:49.850 line:82%
[Example draft in Codex] Count completions
by display. Then ask each person’s preference.
